@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Divulgacao inexistente → esperado: 404 Not Found
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/events/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/publish
Accept: application/json

### Nome vazio no cadastro → esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}
